        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Academic Partnerships Lead Us to Success Act or the A PLUS Act</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>This bill creates a framework under which states may receive federal elementary and secondary education funds on a consolidated basis and use such funds for any educational purpose permitted by state law.</p>",
